OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFrequent showers or longer
OL,6,Fspells of rain feed in from the
OL,7,Fnorthwest through the day, heavy and
OL,8,Fthundery at times. Best of any
OL,9,Fbrighter spells in the east later in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FScattered showers in the
OL,13,Fevening, the odd heavy one at first. A
OL,14,Ffew showers continue overnight but
OL,15,Flighter and more isolated with
OL,16,Fincreasing clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
