OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA few light showers in the
OL,6,Fmorning, but increasingly dry with
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Gradually cloudier with
OL,8,Fsome showers in afternoon then a band
OL,9,Fof heavy rain pushes east in evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FFrequent heavy and blustery showers on
OL,13,FThursday. Showers easing Friday
OL,14,Fmorning with bright spells, then
OL,15,Ffurther rain spreading east later.
OL,16,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
